onesimus (25.1.2+onesimus.0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version scheme: <compatible Bareos version>+onesimus.<Onesimus version>
  * gRPC over TLS with console login, mDNS announcement
  * oconsole: MCP server mode (--mcp), gRPC with certificate pinning
  * JSON API mode compatible with Bareos 25.1.2 (list/llist, dot commands,
    .defaults, .help, status, version, reload); C++ BNET framing
  * config: brace values (DirAddresses), braces in quoted values,
    file and line in parse errors
  * reload no longer terminates the Director

 -- Joerg Bernau <joerg@bernau.family>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0200

