onesimusd (0.25.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * TLS-PSK accept: C++ bconsole connects to Rust Director
  * Full Restore end-to-end: 451 files, 67MB, 0 errors
  * Config parser: bareos-dir.d/*/*.conf (C++ compatible, one level deep)
  * Config parser: case-insensitive directive keys
  * Job Worker: EOD signal to FD after "2000 OK storage end"
  * SD CatReq proxy: GetVolInfo + UpdateMedia during restore

 -- Joerg Bernau <joerg@bernau.family>  Sun, 22 Mar 2026 18:00:00 +0100

onesimusd (0.25.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split into two packages: onesimusd + brconsole
  * Tab-completion from Director AST, readline, syntax coloring
  * All CLI switches compatible with C++ bareos-dir
  * Config directory tree support (/etc/bareos/bareos-dir.d/)
  * 135 unit tests, 8192 parallel connections verified

